{
  "rationale": "The plant automata model the robot's motion commands and perception outcomes. The specification automata bind sensor outcomes to safe, coverage-oriented actions, enforce conservative obstacle recovery, and ensure that full_rotate and move_backward are used only as last-resort or brief escape actions. The design prioritizes forward and random_walk exploration, with short directed turns for obstacle recovery, and only escalates to full_rotate if repeated blockages occur.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception to reflect open-loop actuation and sensor-driven transitions.",
    "Specification automata bind perception outcomes to safe actions, enforce conservative recovery, and prevent unsafe or oscillatory behaviors, while maximizing forward coverage."
